# Fonts
# backend/Fonts holds a full Windows font dump (~392 MB). The certificate
# generator only ever loads Cambria for headings - everything else it uses
# is a pdf-lib built-in - so track just those two faces, as the ERP portal does.
backend/Fonts/*
!backend/Fonts/cambriab.ttf
!backend/Fonts/cambria.ttc
